{"repo_name": "micronaut-projects/micronaut-core", "repo_url": "https://github.com/micronaut-projects/micronaut-core.git", "commit": "1e2ba2c14386af3d47751732d02053a72b0b49b3", "agent": "agent1", "model": "polito/deepseek-v4", "status": "ok", "response": "Now let me analyze the changes carefully.\n\n## Analysis\n\n### File 01: `DefaultHtmlErrorResponseBodyProvider.java`\n\n**Before:** The cache was an unbounded `ConcurrentHashMap`:\n```java\nprivate final Map<HtmlErrorPage, String> cache = new ConcurrentHashMap<>();\n```\n\n**After:** Replaced with a bounded `ConcurrentLinkedHashMap` capped at 100 entries:\n```java\nprivate static final int MAX_CACHE_SIZE = 100;\nprivate final Map<HtmlErrorPage, String> cache = new ConcurrentLinkedHashMap.Builder<HtmlErrorPage, String>()\n    .maximumWeightedCapacity(MAX_CACHE_SIZE)\n    .build();\n```\n\nA getter `getCache()` was also added for testing.\n\n### File 02: `DefaultHtmlErrorResponseBodyProviderCacheMaxSizeTest.java`\n\nA new test file that validates the cache stays bounded at 100 entries even when 110 distinct error-generating requests are made.\n\n### Security Impact\n\nThe core issue is **Uncontrolled Resource Consumption**. The original code used an unbounded `ConcurrentHashMap` as a cache for error HTML pages. The `HtmlErrorPage` record keys include `locale`, `httpStatusCode`, `httpStatusReason`, `error`, `errorBold`, and `messages` — all of which vary per request. An attacker could craft thousands of distinct requests (e.g., varying query parameters, headers, paths) that produce different `HtmlErrorPage` keys, causing the cache to grow without bound and exhaust server heap memory — a **denial-of-service** condition.\n\nThe fix caps the cache at 100 entries, preventing unbounded memory growth. This directly mitigates the resource-exhaustion vector.\n\n### Classification\n\nThis is a security vulnerability fix: **CWE-400 (Uncontrolled Resource Consumption)**.\n\nVULNERABILITY_FOUND: yes\nCWE_ID: CWE-400\nCWE_NAME: Uncontrolled Resource Consumption\n", "output_dir": "/home/medo/laMiaTesi/agentAnalysisDocker/outputs/polito_deepseek-v4/micronaut-projects__micronaut-core/1e2ba2c14386/agent1", "created_at": "2026-08-07T14:14:35.557347+00:00"}
